{"id":"01413b346ec50f94","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-variety-hsp.md","title":"Variety HSP","display":"Variety HSP","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-variety-hsp","aliases":["93-fact-variety-hsp"],"display":"Variety HSP","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-variety-hsp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-variety-hsp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Variety HSP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span> is a class of algebras of a fixed similarity type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced one-place validity predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the type-indexed homomorphic-image/subalgebra/product closure of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\\)</span> is the least variety containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}variety\\text{-}hsp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathbb K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}variety\\text{-}hsp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathbb K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The HSP fact establishes that the variety generated by a class of algebras equals the closure of that class under the three fundamental algebraic operations: taking homomorphic images, subalgebras, and products. This is the foundational result of universal algebra relating abstract classes to concrete constructions.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}$ is the type-indexed homomorphic-image/subalgebra/product closure of [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)$ is the least variety containing $\\mathbb K$ (see [[93-df-variety]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}variety\\text{-}hsp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathbb K).","display":true}],"bytes":1343,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d2061022c1cccc3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d","97b46a497e251f9f","6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}